.TH LIBMPQ__WRITER_FINISH 3 2026-08-18 "The MoPaQ archive library"
.SH NAME
libmpq__writer_finish \- finish an MPQ file writer
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B
#include <libmpq/mpq.h>
.sp
.BI "int32_t libmpq__writer_finish("
.BI "        mpq_writer_s   *" "writer"
.BI ");"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Validates the declared size, writes the file sectors and records its hash and
block entry. Incomplete streams are rejected.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR libmpq__writer_begin (3),
.BR libmpq__writer_write (3)
